#6930
A dark cave.~
As you enter the cave it takes a minute for your eyes to adjust.
It is so dark it is hard to make out the surrounding walls.  It's
as if the light from your torches is being absorbed.  As you 
explore the cave you notice a fine outline in shape of a door
in the far left corner.  Where does it lead?
~
