#6943
Before the gates of hell.~
The room gives you a cold chill throughout your body as you enter.
The stinch of death brings on a strong sudden urge to puke.  You
are able to control yourself and look about the room.  Rocks
rest on the ground here, steam rolling off them as if they were
resting on fire.  A set of stairs lead upward into darkness.  To
the north you can hear a loud *HOWL*.
~
