#6975
A Circular Stone Altar.~
     A large stone circle encompasses you as you take in the 
sights of this prehistoric altar.  Blood stains the stones of
the altar and the surrounding rocks.  Village huts, made of wood
and straw, stand off in the distance.  The smell tells you much
time has not passed since the altar had seen it's last victim.
~
